      "file": "about.html",
      "before": "\n<section class=\"rich-band\"><div class=\"shell text-column\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Electrical work</span><h2>Kitchen lighting and renovation wiring</h2><p>Our electrical work includes lighting and power-point repairs, fault finding and planned installation. We assess the existing connections, fitting positions and controls so the written quote identifies the work needed for the property.</p><figure><picture data-responsive-media><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-responsive-480.avif 480w, images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-responsive-960.avif 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:600px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width:800px) 50vw, 390px\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-responsive-480.webp 480w, images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-responsive-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:600px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width:800px) 50vw, 390px\" src=\"images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide.jpg\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" alt=\"Kitchen with installed downlights during renovation\"></picture><figcaption>Recessed downlights across the kitchen ceiling, with power points at the bench and island.</figcaption></figure><p>Lighting installation includes the fitting, intended location, controls and connection requirements. A repair to an existing light and a new lighting location can involve different work. See <a href=\"lighting-installation-perth.html\">lighting installation and repairs</a> or <a href=\"switchboard-upgrades-perth.html\">switchboard repairs and upgrades</a> for the relevant work and quotation scope.</p></div></section>",
      "after": "",
      "count": 1
    },
