      "file": "lighting-installation-perth.html",
      "before": "\n<section class=\"section expanded-scenarios\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-scenarios\">Lighting faults, fitting replacement and new installations</h2><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>LED downlight flickering with a dimmer</h3><p>Several downlights flicker when the dimmer is used, but one room is worse. Tell us which fittings are affected and whether the behaviour changes with the control. A fitting, driver, dimmer or wiring issue can look similar; the symptom alone does not identify the component to replace.</p></div><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>Replacing a fitting or planning new lighting</h3><p>For a replacement light fitting, share the intended product and existing position. New lighting locations may need a different cable route or control arrangement. We check the proposed use, access and compatibility rather than assuming a new fitting can connect unchanged.</p></div></div></section>",
      "after": "\n<section class=\"section expanded-scenarios\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-scenarios\">Lighting faults, fitting replacement and new installations</h2><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>LED downlight flickering with a dimmer</h3><p>Several downlights flicker when the dimmer is used, but one room is worse. Tell us which fittings are affected and whether the behaviour changes with the control. A fitting, driver, dimmer or wiring issue can look similar; the symptom alone does not identify the component to replace.</p></div><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>Replacing a fitting or planning new lighting</h3><p>For a replacement light fitting, share the intended product and existing position. New lighting locations may need a different cable route or control arrangement. We check the proposed use, access and compatibility rather than assuming a new fitting can connect unchanged.</p></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"rich-band\"><div class=\"shell text-column\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Electrical work</span><h2>Kitchen lighting and renovation wiring</h2><p>Our electrical work includes lighting and power-point repairs, fault finding and planned installation. We assess the existing connections, fitting positions and controls so the written quote identifies the work needed for the property.</p><figure><picture data-responsive-media><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-responsive-480.avif 480w, images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-responsive-960.avif 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:600px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width:800px) 50vw, 390px\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-responsive-480.webp 480w, images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-responsive-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:600px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width:800px) 50vw, 390px\" src=\"images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide.jpg\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" alt=\"Kitchen with installed downlights during renovation\"></picture><figcaption>Recessed downlights across the kitchen ceiling, with power points at the bench and island.</figcaption></figure><p>Lighting installation includes the fitting, intended location, controls and connection requirements. A repair to an existing light and a new lighting location can involve different work. See <a href=\"lighting-installation-perth.html\">lighting installation and repairs</a> or <a href=\"switchboard-upgrades-perth.html\">switchboard repairs and upgrades</a> for the relevant work and quotation scope.</p></div></section>",
      "count": 1
